4.	During the quarter ended June 30, 2022, the Parent acquired the entire remaining shareholding of 49.99% in Terminix SIS India Private Limited (‘Terminix’), a subsidiary of the Parent, for an aggregate consideration of INR 7.77 million which resulted in Terminix becoming a wholly owned subsidiary of the Parent. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
5.	During the quarter ended June 30, 2022, the Board appointed Mr. Upendra Kumar Sinha as an Additional Director (Independent) effective June 29, 2022 based on the recommendations of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee of the Board. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
